              "zh-CN": "人工检查 AI 和 JSON 操作日志样例。",
              "en": "Manually inspect AI and JSON operation log samples."
            },
            {
              "zh-CN": "storage 损坏恢复日志契约仍需 P1 补齐。",
              "en": "Storage corruption recovery logging contract remains P1."
            }
